00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:26.710
I mean, pizzas, hot dogs,
we were ordering barbecue.

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:28.510
It was bad.

00:01:28.510 --> 00:01:32.080
And the data center team
came to us and said,

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:33.730
you can't eat on the
data center floor.

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:35.305
