00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:41.770
And we haven't eaten.

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:43.490
We haven't done anything.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:45.994
And they said, well, we're
right next door to the police

00:01:45.994 --> 00:01:48.160
station, so if you don't
take this food out of here,

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.050
