00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:58.630
So we took the food out and,
you know, moved forward.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:00.520
But that's kind of
been my background

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:03.520
and what I've been doing for
the last 15 years, right?

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:06.820
Prior to working at
